<%= content_for :page_title, "This change would leave too few active users" %>

<h1 class="govuk-heading-l">This change would leave too few active users</h1>

<p class="govuk-body">
  The Register must always have at least <%= User::MINIMUM_ACTIVE_INTERNAL_USERS %> active users who are not API users.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  Make another user active, or keep this user as an internal user, then try again.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  If you have any questions, email <%= support_email %>.
</p>
